config ROTHKO_MINET
	tristate "Rothko per-UID traffic accounting (minet)"
	depends on INET && IPV6 && NF_CONNTRACK
	help
	  Provide the minet Generic Netlink interface used by the Rothko
	  vendor daemon for per-UID TCP and UDP traffic accounting.
	  Accounting starts when the daemon adds a UID to monitor.
	  If built as a module, it will be called minet.
